ification is not a conflict. Judge conflict only.","type":"choice"},"relevant":{"criteria":{"no":"The item is about a different component or activity and touches neither the installer's handling of skill files nor the published manifest.","unclear":"The item text is too vague to tell which component or activity it changes.","yes":"The item plans, changes, or depends on the atm-bd installer's handling of the skill's files (agents, skills, Python files) or on the published file manifest, directly or as a clear prerequisite."},"instructions":"The state holds one planning item (`item.title`, `item.text`) and one anchor: a directive in `anchor.statement`, with the area it governs in `anchor.scope`. Does the work in `item.text` touch the subject of `anchor.statement`: how the atm-bd installer handles or installs the skill's files, or the published per-file manifest that the installer checks them against? Judge overlap of subject matter only. Do not judge whether the item obeys the anchor.","type":"choice"}}},"sealed_question_set_digest_after":"8b33c4a2f780d7ebf4a6cb6639ed6867026ab51bb06a9be49e39814abfb7b83d","sealed_question_set_digest_before":null,"semantic_score":{"exact_role_cells":33,"exact_semantic_verdicts":11,"regressions":0,"stable_cases":11,"total_cases":11,"total_role_cells":33,"total_semantic_verdicts":11},"tournament_protocol_version":"plan-anchor/question-tournament/2.0.0","tuning_history_after":{"events":[{"authority":{"anchor_id":"ANC-088","anchor_record_sha256":"648af25535b92fc2d68600f9dbe976c52afe16f5d7e012bb9fc145709b96c287","anchor_version":2,"intent_id":"phase-bj","intent_sha256":"e5d9e1e48df29bf874f8310256ea851ce17795770523139fbe56b4ea255c9382","intent_version":1},"candidate":{"candidate_id":"candidate-2","question_sha256":"8b33c4a2f780d7ebf4a6cb6639ed6867026ab51bb06a9be49e39814abfb7b83d"},"decision":{"question_set_sha256":"8b33c4a2f780d7ebf4a6cb6639ed6867026ab51bb06a9be49e39814abfb7b83d","reason_code":"TOURNAMENT.ACCEPTED","status":"sealed"},"event":